%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "20px"}, "flowchart": {"useMaxWidth": false, "nodeSpacing": 55, "rankSpacing": 55}}}%%
flowchart TB
    Open[Practitioner opens update dashboard]
    Query[Query pending updates for firm]
    Read[Read version cursors and cached summaries]
    Show[Display accumulated update impact]
    Choose{Practitioner decision}
    Process[Engagement System validates target version]
    Outcome{Processing result}

    Open --> Query
    Query --> Read
    Read --> Show
    Show --> Choose
    Choose -->|APPLY| Process
    Choose -->|DECLINE| Process
    Process --> Outcome

    Outcome -->|APPLY completed| Apply[Set applied and evaluated cursors to target]
    Outcome -->|DECLINE completed| Decline[Keep applied cursor and advance evaluated cursor]
    Outcome -->|Failure| Failure[Do not change metadata]

    Apply --> ApplyAudit[Append APPLY audit record]
    Decline --> DeclineAudit[Append DECLINE audit record]
    Failure --> Pending[Keep update pending]

    ApplyAudit --> Concurrent{Newer version exists?}
    DeclineAudit --> Concurrent
    Concurrent -->|Yes| NewPending[Keep newer version pending]
    Concurrent -->|No| Complete[Decision complete]
